  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left|f^{\\prime}(x)\\right| \\leq 5$\r\n$\\int_{0}^{1}-5 d x \\leq \\int_{0}^{1} f^{\\prime}(x) d x \\leq \\int_{0}^{1} 5 d x$\r\n$\\Rightarrow-5 \\leq f(1)-0 \\leq 5$\r\n$\\Rightarrow-5 \\leq f(1) \\leq 5$\r\n$\\Rightarrow f(1) \\in[-5,5]$",
